    "article_summary": "The article describes a photocatalytic C2-alkylation of tryptophan (Trp) residues in peptides using bromodifluoroacetate and bromodifluoroacetamide-derived radical precursors. The method utilizes the organic photocatalyst 4CzIPN under visible light (450 nm) in DMSO, offering a rapid, additive-free, and chemoselective late-stage functionalization strategy that tolerates diverse proteinogenic functional groups and is applicable to complex biologically relevant peptides.",
